I've played a bunch of games with the kg weight display, and I'm
pretty happy with it. I like having it in kg because it gives me a
good sense of scale. When it is just in nethack-weight-units I just
end up thinking of stuff in terms of how many food rations they
weight, which is fine, but slightly less natural. Anyway, I'm pleased
with how the mod has worked out; and I'm sticking with 50g / per unit.

