What I was trying to covey is that I've chosen not to show weights of
stuff on the floor because I don't want the loadstone to be
identifiable just by looking at it. Once you pick it up, the weight is
visible. Apart from loadstones, the only thing I can think of which
can be weight identified is a bag of holding. Before this mod, I use
to identify BoH by putting something heavy in the bag while I was
close to the burden limit =96 now I can work it out regardless of how
much other stuff I'm carrying. It's a slightly easier, but I think
it's fair. Actually, while making this mod I discovered that there is
a bug causes empty non-cursed bags of holding to weight 1 unit more
than all the other kinds of bags. (I've fixed that.)


